  "priorExpiration": "2017-05-23",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-W 567.03 Provider Participation. Each participating hearing aid services provider shall be:\n\n(a) One of the following:\n\n(1) An audiologist licensed in accordance with RSA 137-F:11 or licensed by the state in which he or she practices; or\n\n(2) A hearing aid dealer registered in accordance with RSA 137-F:8 or credentialed in accordance with applicable law in the state in which he or she practices; and\n\n(b) A New Hampshire enrolled medicaid provider.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading He-W 500); ss by #6157, eff 12-29-95, EXPIRED: 12-29-03\n\nNew. #9480, eff 5-23-09, EXPIRED: 5-23-17\n\nNew. #12538, eff 5-25-18",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-w500.html"
